The legislative texts in this repository are from legislation.mt (Legislation Unit, Government of Malta).
The Copyright Act (Cap. 415, article 2) excludes "any written law" from literary works, save as provided in
article 12 of the Statute Law Revision Act, 1980. The texts are reproduced without change to their wording.

Lexifina's own contributions (tools, file arrangement, commit messages and documentation) are dedicated to the
public domain under CC0 1.0: https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/
